figdown 0.1 table
# 0.1 (`POSITIONAL-LIST-SPELLING`): the table `width` space form is retired, exactly as
# `rank`'s is — same rule, same diagnostic shape. `COMMA-LIST-WHITESPACE`: whitespace after a
# comma is not a spelling either.
table t "T"
| A | B | C |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 2 | 3 |
width auto 90 25%
table u "U"
| A | B | C |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 2 | 3 |
width auto,90 25%
